     "citation": "Manufacturer data for mullion-transom facade systems: mullion 50 x 150 mm about 5.5 kg/m, transom 50 x 100 about 4.5 kg/m, spandrel as enamelled 6 mm glass with 100 mm mineral wool and 1.5 mm steel back pan. Typical values consulted."
    },
